<title>POLAND: FORECAST - Quarterly Polish company results poll.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Quarterly Polish company results poll.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are analysts' quarterly estimates of full year results of leading Polish companies:</p>
<p>(All forecasts in million zlotys)</p>
<p>				1997 FULL YEAR NET PROFIT</p>
<p>COMPANY----------------MEAN--MEDIAN---RANGE--FORECASTS</p>
<p> Agros Holding *	 69.3   70.0   60.0- 81.3   5</p>
<p> Animex SA		 17.8   18.0   16.0- 19.0   5</p>
<p> BPH SA		   302.0  307.5  267.0-330.0   6</p>
<p> BRE			131.5  132.5  119.0-145.0   6</p>
<p> Bank Slaski SA	 280.2  280.0  245.0-326.0   6</p>
<p> TC Debica SA	    64.6   64.9   58.0- 70.0   6</p>
<p> Kety SA		   37.0   37.8   30.0- 40.0   6</p>
<p> Okocim SA		 22.6   22.0   29.2- 16.0   6</p>
<p> Optimus SA		33.0   36.3   20.1- 41.0   5</p>
<p> Polifarb CN	     25.2   24.2   21.0- 30.5   6</p>
<p> Stomil Olsztyn	  69.2   67.0   65.0- 80.0   6</p>
<p> WBK SA		   174.9  177.5  160.0-190.0   6</p>
<p> Wedel SA		  49.8   48.5   38.0- 64.0   7</p>
<p> Zywiec SA		 26.9   23.4   17.0- 37.9   5</p>
<p>NOTE: Poll conducted by Reuters on June 2. Only forecasts with five or more valid entries were displayed.</p>
<p>Consolidated results marked with an asterisk (*)</p>
<p>FORECASTS CONTRIBUTED BY: BDM PKO BP, DM PBG SA-Pekao SA Group, Creditanstalt Securities SA, Bank Zachodni SA, DM Penetrator, ING BSK Asset Management, BRE Brokers.</p>
